<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Healthcare information | HealthConnect Bharat' }) %>
<main class="directory-wrap healthcare-page">
  <section class="directory-intro"><span class="eyebrow">HealthConnect Bharat · Healthcare</span><h1>Explore care <em>with clarity.</em></h1><p>Browse verified doctors and healthcare organisations, learn about common specialties, and choose the right next step for your care.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/doctors">Browse verified doctors →</a><a class="button quiet" href="/hospitals">Find hospitals &amp; clinics</a></div></section>
  <section class="panel workflow-panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Healthcare discovery</span><h2>Explore by specialty</h2></div></div><div class="healthcare-category-grid"><% const categories=['General Medicine','Cardiology','Dermatology','Pediatrics','Orthopedics','Gynecology','ENT','Dental','Mental health','Diagnostic services','Emergency services']; categories.forEach((category)=>{ %><a class="healthcare-category" href="<%= category==='Diagnostic services'||category==='Emergency services' ? '#services' : '/doctors?q='+encodeURIComponent(category) %>"><span aria-hidden="true">✚</span><strong><%= category %></strong></a><% }) %></div></section>
  <section class="panel workflow-panel" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Services and departments</span><h2>What you can discover</h2></div></div><div class="steps"><article><span class="step-no">01</span><h3>Doctors</h3><p>Search administrator-approved professionals by specialty and city. Profiles show qualifications and practice information entered for review.</p><a class="text-link" href="/doctors">Search the doctor directory →</a></article><article><span class="step-no">02</span><h3>Hospitals &amp; clinics</h3><p>Browse approved organisations by location, department, services and registered facilities.</p><a class="text-link" href="/hospitals">Search hospitals →</a></article><article><span class="step-no">03</span><h3>Choose your next step</h3><p>Availability varies by provider. Sign in with a patient account to request an appointment with an available doctor.</p><a class="text-link" href="/register">Create a patient account →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="panel workflow-panel"><span class="eyebrow">General health awareness</span><h2>Use information as a starting point</h2><p>Preventive check-ups, vaccinations, healthy routines and timely professional advice can support wellbeing. A general information page cannot assess your symptoms or provide a personal diagnosis; consult a qualified healthcare professional for individual guidance.</p><h3>When to contact a clinician</h3><p>Contact a healthcare professional when a health concern is new, worsening, persistent, or affecting daily life. If you think someone is in immediate danger, contact local emergency services.</p></section>
  <section class="panel workflow-panel" id="emergency"><span class="eyebrow">Urgent care</span><h2>Emergency information</h2><p>This website is not an emergency-response service and does not dispatch help. For urgent or life-threatening symptoms, call your local emergency number or go to the nearest emergency department. Use the hospital directory to discover facilities; availability and emergency capability must be confirmed directly with the facility.</p><a class="button quiet" href="/hospitals">Find a hospital or clinic →</a></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
